<title>UK: Grande Dixence sets 125 million Sfr 12-year bond.</title>
<headline>Grande Dixence sets 125 million Sfr 12-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GRANDE DIXENCE SA.</p>
<p> AMT    125 MLN SFR   COUPON     4.25 PCT  MATURITY    16.JAN.09</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.35    PAY DATE    16.JAN.97</p>
<p> NOTES	GLOBAL CERTIFICATES.</p>
<p>		THERE IS A REOPENING CLAUSE.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
